#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:5597
msgid ""
"Set up a finger to unlock the screen and say yes when Monet asks for your password"
msgstr ""
"Nastavte prst, který odemkne obrazovku a řekne ano, když Monet požádá o heslo"

