#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:5711
msgid ""
"Turn it on and join it to your Wi-Fi: Monet finds most printers by itself"
msgstr "Zapněte ji a připojte k Wi-Fi: většinu tiskáren Monet najde sám"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:5714
