msgstr "Kontrola Monetu"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6611
msgid "See that Windows, Secure Boot and switching are all set up"
msgstr "Ověří, že Windows, Secure Boot a přepínání jsou správně nastavené"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6614
msgid "Check"
msgstr "Zkontrolovat"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6642
msgid "Ready when you come back"
msgstr "Připraveno, až se vrátíte"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6643
msgid ""
"After Windows, Monet starts your desktop behind the lock screen, so it's there as soon as you type your password."
msgstr ""
"Po Windows spustí Monet vaši plochu za zamykací obrazovkou, takže je připravená, jakmile zadáte heslo."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6658
msgid "Open your apps again"
msgstr "Znovu otevřít aplikace"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6659
