#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6684
msgid "Monet and your apps keep themselves up to date."
msgstr "Monet i vaše aplikace se aktualizují samy."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6735 linux/libexec/monet-quick:5173
